  "title": "ARMOUR Residential REIT, Inc. Confirms July 2026 Common Share and Q3 2026 Series C Preferred Share Dividends",
  "summary": "VERO BEACH, Florida, July 01, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ARMOUR Residential REIT, Inc. (NYSE: ARR and ARR-PRC) (“ARMOUR” or the “Company”) today confirmed the July 2026 cash dividend for the Company's Common Stock, consistent with the previous guidance which the Company released on June 24, 2026.",
